              "value": "Trigger: A foe critically succeeds at a Strike against the arboreal sapstriker with a weapon that deals piercing or slashing damage, or a foe deals damage to an arboreal sapstriker with an axe\n\nThe arboreal sapstriker attempts to Disarm the triggering foe's weapon, using its Fortitude modifier in place of its Athletics modifier. If it critically succeeds, the weapon is lodged into the sapstriker rather than falling to the ground. A creature can retrieve a lodged weapon by Disarming the sapstriker as if it were wielding the weapon."
